      "source": "https://hometownhistorymaps.com/pages/history-of-brooksville-kentucky",
      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Sanborn Fire Insurance Maps from 1909 reveal Brooksville’s downtown layout, labeled businesses, schools, and hotels, offering a visual history.",
